{"id": "unknown-2026-05-25-009", "date": "2026-05-25", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["supply_chain_shift"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "India seeks bids from states for 50 industrial parks under ‘BHAVYA’", "content": "India’s Department for Promotion of Industry and Internal Trade has released the detailed operational guidelines for implementing the BHAVYA scheme, which provides for development of 100 industrial parks between FY27 and FY32, with a total financial outlay of nearly $3.57 billion. \nIn the first phase, up to 50 industrial parks will be taken up through a challenge-based competitive selection process. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_textile", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/textile-news/india-seeks-bids-from-states-for-50-industrial-parks-under-bhavya--310516-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-05-25-010", "date": "2026-05-25", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q2", "month": 5, "week": 22, "weekday": "Mon"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.62, "keywords": ["record", "growth", "increase", "expand"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "US’ Deckers sees continued growth momentum for HOKA and UGG in FY26", "content": "Deckers Brands has reported record FY26 revenue of $5.47 billion, up 9.8 per cent YoY, with diluted EPS rising 11 per cent to $7.02, driven by strong HOKA and UGG sales. \nFourth-quarter revenue increased 9.6 per cent to $1.12 billion. \nThe company forecast high-single-digit sales growth for FY27 and expanded its share repurchase authorisation to approximately $5 billion. ", "sources": [{"name": "fibre2fashion_apparel", "url": "https://www.fibre2fashion.com/news/apparel-news/us-deckers-sees-continued-growth-momentum-for-hoka-and-ugg-in-fy26-310521-newsdetails.htm", "type": "rss"}]}
